WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.900
Dyoro wã, d sẽn na n ta zĩig ningã. A yaa lobik lagem-n-taase.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.442
Valtã sẽn yaa wĩntoog la zĩndi. Neb nins sẽn boond tɩ Lobi wã tagsdame t'a ra ket n tẽrda bũmb a ye.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.520
Wakat kãnga, tẽngã sẽn da be mogrã pʋga ra pa le kõt ned rɩɩbo ye.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.034
A Dean tigma a zakã rãmba. D ra segd n loogame, la ko-kãsengã zugẽ wã bala.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:08.586
B waa n ta ko-kãsengã zugu. Koɛɛgã ra gũuda koom-koglgã.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:24.698
Ned baa a yen ka saag n kẽng taoor ye. La nin-kẽemã kolgame n ta ko-kãsengã sɛɛgẽ.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:36.002
River, bas f kambã tɩ b tũ. D na n wa pʋʋs-y lame, tõnd ne neb nins sẽn na n dog yãmbã.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:48.432
La vẽenema zĩnd koomã zugu, la ko-kãsengã sĩndi.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:02.506
Bãmb kẽe ko-kãsengã pʋgẽ ne b nusẽ. Bi-riblã rɩka ninsaalb yãoogo.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:13.456
Kẽerã ra geta b sẽn loogdã, la b pa zab ye.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:35.970
B kẽnga tẽn-paalg sẽn be mogrã nugẽ wã. B pʋʋsda ko-kãsengã barka.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:05.426
Yʋʋm wʋsg sẽn looge, kom-bɩɩsã leb n leoke. Yaa Dyoro, sẽn sɩng-a to-to wã.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:22.922
Bũmb nins sẽn maand be wã ket n yaa yel-solemde. La tõnd sẽn mi yaa tɩ b loogda ne sũ-bʋgsem, wa b yaab rãmbã.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:44.386
Rẽ poore, b lebg n waame. Tẽngã reeg-b lame ne yɩɩl.

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:17.372
B kẽnga tẽn-kãense, wa tõnd me.

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:24.322
Wĩndgẽ wã, nin-kẽem dãmbã zĩnda koomã noore. Koɛɛgã tẽega.
